水线","tags":[],"url":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline"},"340":{"id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline-0","page_id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline","content":"本文记录了如何从零开始使用 Azure DevOps 创建一个完整的 CI/CD 流水线，实现代码自动构建、打包镜像、推送到阿里云镜像仓库，并部署到远程服务器。适用于个人项目或小型团队实践 DevOps 自动化部署。"},"341":{"id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline-1","page_id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline#为什么使用-azure-pipeline","content":"为什么使用 Azure Pipeline"},"342":{"id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline-2","page_id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline#注册-azure-devops-账号","content":"注册 Azure DevOps 账号"},"343":{"id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline-3","page_id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline#创建-pipeline","content":"创建 Pipeline"},"344":{"id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline-4","page_id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline#配置-pipeline","content":"配置 Pipeline"},"345":{"id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline-5","page_id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline#首先是代码","content":"首先是代码"},"346":{"id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline-6","page_id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline#其次就是服务器","content":"其次就是服务器"},"347":{"id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline-7","page_id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline#配置-pipeline-各阶段任务","content":"配置 Pipeline 各阶段任务"},"348":{"id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline-8","page_id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline#阶段-1打包镜像并发布到阿里云容器仓库","content":"阶段 1：打包镜像并发布到阿里云容器仓库"},"349":{"id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline-9","page_id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline#阶段-2部署到远程服务器","content":"阶段 2：部署到远程服务器"},"350":{"id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline-10","page_id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline#总结","content":"总结"},"351":{"id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline-11","page_id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline#为什么使用-azure-pipeline","content":"Azure Pipeline 是 Azure DevOps 提供的持续集成与持续部署（CI/CD）工具。使用它可以简化服务的打包与部署过程，免去手动操作服务器的麻烦，提升可维护性与可监控性。本文选择 Azure Pipeline 是因为公司正在评估 Azure DevOps 作为企业级 CI/CD 方案，同时 Azure DevOps 为个人用户提供了免费额度，非常适合入门与实验。"},"352":{"id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline-12","page_id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline#注册-azure-devops-账号","content":"azure devops 官网"},"353":{"id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline-13","page_id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline#注册-azure-devops-账号","content":"先在官网注册账号。注册账号之后，就需要创建组织了。"},"354":{"id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline-14","page_id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline#注册-azure-devops-账号","content":"组织创建完成之后，创建一个项目，就可以使用自己的devops了。"},"355":{"id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline-15","page_id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline#创建-pipeline","content":"在azure devops里，可以直接不管敏捷开发那一套，直接来使用pipeline功能。"},"356":{"id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline-16","page_id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline#创建-pipeline","content":"代码位置选择自己所用的代码仓库。"},"357":{"id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline-17","page_id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline#创建-pipeline","content":"选择好代码仓库之后，就会让你选择具体的代码repository"},"358":{"id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline-18","page_id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline#创建-pipeline","content":"azure会根据你的代码类型自动的创建一个pipeline的yaml文件。这个可以不用管。"},"359":{"id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline-19","page_id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline#创建-pipeline","content":"到目前为止，你的yaml文件就创建好了。"},"360":{"id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline-20","page_id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline#配置-pipeline","content":"刚开始创建的pipeline是根据项目语言自动识别的。到这里就需要更加的深入理解pipeline是什么了。\n首先，pipeline是一个流水线，也就是你的代码会经过一系列的步骤，然后才能部署到你的服务器。\npipeline的步骤可以分成三个部分："},"361":{"id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline-21","page_id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline#配置-pipeline","content":"构建步骤：也就是你的代码编译打包，生成可执行的文件。"},"362":{"id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline-22","page_id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline#配置-pipeline","content":"发布包到你的服务器，比如你的代码编译打包之后，生成了一个可执行的文件，但是这个文件需要部署到你的服务器上，才能被服务器部署。"},"363":{"id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline-23","page_id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline#配置-pipeline","content":"远程执行服务器部署。"},"364":{"id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline-24","page_id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline#配置-pipeline","content":"正常一个普通的项目就可以这么使用pipeline进行部署。说起来简单，但是部署的每个单元都需要准备好。"},"365":{"id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline-25","page_id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline#首先是代码","content":"为了能方便适应所有的环境，我决定使用docker来部署应用。那么，就需要给自己的项目配置dockerFile。\n并确保能正确的打出镜像，镜像可用。"},"366":{"id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline-26","page_id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline#其次就是服务器","content":"服务器需要能接收到镜像，并且能正确部署。我们可以在打包的时候，把镜像文件保存起来直接传输到服务器上，\n然后在服务器上load这个镜像文件，再部署到服务器的容器了。这个方法是可行的，但其实比较繁琐。而且你每次构建的镜像\n并没有被保存起来，也不合适。生产的镜像最好有个归档。起码保存3个版本。所以，我决定使用docker hub来保存镜像。\n准备一个docker registry\ndocker hub虽然是可以用的，但是国内的网络环境访问还是很慢的。所以我这边直接使用了\n阿里云的容器仓库服务。\n注册一个阿里云容器仓库"},"367":{"id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline-27","page_id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline#其次就是服务器","content":"阿里云的仓库可以免费使用3个命名空间，共计300个仓库。还是蛮划算的。指示流量有限制，具体可以看个人版的文档。"},"368":{"id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline-28","page_id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline#其次就是服务器","content":"服务器配置有了阿里云镜像之后，就是要配置服务器的环境了。"},"369":{"id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline-29","page_id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline#其次就是服务器","content":"安装一个docker的容器环境。"},"370":{"id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline-30","page_id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline#其次就是服务器","content":"测试docker能否登陆阿里云的容器仓库。"},"371":{"id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline-31","page_id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline#其次就是服务器","content":"尝试在本地项目打包镜像并上传到阿里云容器仓库，并在服务器下载镜像并部署。确实可以之后。就可以去pipeline\n完成这一整个链路了。这里还涉及到如何使用pass保存镜像仓库的密钥，避免密钥泄漏。还要通过GPG来加密密钥。后续再补充。"},"372":{"id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline-32","page_id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline#其次就是服务器","content":"到目前为止，我们完成了基础的 YAML 文件配置。接下来我们将详细拆解每个阶段的配置细节。"},"373":{"id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline-33","page_id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline#配置-pipeline-各阶段任务","content":"yaml语法\npipeline的配置完全是通过yaml文件来完成的。所以需要线学习一个pipeline的yaml语法（这里假设你已经懂yaml本身的格式了）。\n跟jenkins的pipeline类似，azure的pipeline也是树形的结构。大致可以分为三层。"},"374":{"id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline-34","page_id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline#配置-pipeline-各阶段任务","content":"stages: stage是pipeline的最大执行单元，可以用与分割多个阶段的继承代码"},"375":{"id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline-35","page_id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline#配置-pipeline-各阶段任务","content":"jobs: job是stage的最小执行单元，可以包含多个tasks。一个stage可以有多个job。"},"376":{"id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline-36","page_id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline#配置-pipeline-各阶段任务","content":"task: task是job下的分支，一个job可以包含多个tasks，比较特殊的是，job下的task是通过steps来关联的。"},"377":{"id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline-37","page_id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline#配置-pipeline-各阶段任务","content":"service connection在pipeline中，需要使用service connection来连接你的服务器。包括ssh连接服务器，还有登陆阿里云镜像仓库来push镜像。\n创建一个镜像仓库的service connection。可以在项目设置里找到服务链接，创建一个 docker registry即可。"},"378":{"id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline-38","page_id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline#阶段-1打包镜像并发布到阿里云容器仓库","content":"这是一个任务单元，使用的是azure pipeline预设的任务"},"379":{"id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline-39","page_id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline#阶段-1打包镜像并发布到阿里云容器仓库","content":"command决定了这个预设任务做什么，\n这是约定好的值不能改，这个command就是构建docker镜像并发布到镜像仓库。"},"380":{"id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline-40","page_id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline#阶段-1打包镜像并发布到阿里云容器仓库","content":"containerRegistry\n就是我们配置好的仓库的service connection名称。"},"381":{"id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline-41","page_id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline#阶段-1打包镜像并发布到阿里云容器仓库","content":"repository就是我们push的镜像 命名空间/仓库名"},"382":{"id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline-42","page_id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline#阶段-1打包镜像并发布到阿里云容器仓库","content":"Dockerfile就是我们项目里已经编写好的dockerfile文件。"},"383":{"id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline-43","page_id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline#阶段-1打包镜像并发布到阿里云容器仓库","content":"这个任务就可以实现打包我们的项目镜像并发布到配置中心了"},"384":{"id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline-44","page_id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline#阶段-2部署到远程服务器","content":"创建 ssh 链接托管（service connection）将服务务器部署到服务器上，需要用到ssh连接服务器。这里继续使用 azure 的 service connection 来创建\nssh 链接的托管。\n服务器准备好脚本在服务器上需要准备好需要的脚本，方便直接部署。 现在继续写 pipeline 的 stage2。"},"385":{"id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline-45","page_id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline#阶段-2部署到远程服务器","content":"这里就直接看任务单元，\ntask:SSH@0 这也是预设的 pipeline 命令\n使用这个任务就可以借助配置好的 ssh 托管登录上远程服务器并执行命令。"},"386":{"id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline-46","page_id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline#阶段-2部署到远程服务器","content":"sshEndpoint 就是我创建的 ecs ssh 托管"},"387":{"id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline-47","page_id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline#阶段-2部署到远程服务器","content":"runOptions: 'inline' 是命令行的运行选项。总共可以设置三个，具体看 devops 文档。"},"388":{"id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline-48","page_id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline#阶段-2部署到远程服务器","content":"inline：这就是 inline 模式下，把服务器脚本直接写在 pipeline 中。"},"389":{"id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline-49","page_id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline#阶段-2部署到远程服务器","content":"从命令中可以看到我写的比较复杂，实际还用了环境变量，这块没有整理好，主要是为了保证\n密码安全。"},"390":{"id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline-50","page_id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline#阶段-2部署到远程服务器","content":"按照上面的步骤，基本就完成了一个自己的可以运维的脚本配置了。"},"391":{"id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline-51","page_id":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/azure_pipeline#总结","content":"本文介绍了如何使用 Azure DevOps 构建一个完整的 CI/CD 流水线，涵盖项目打包、镜像构建、推送至镜像仓库，以及远程服务器部署的全过程。通过结合 Docker 与 Azure Pipeline 的服务连接配置，能够实现端到端的自动化部署。后续还可继续拓展如构建缓存、蓝绿部署、安全审计等功能，进一步提升部署效率与安全性。"},"392":{"id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization","page_id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization","type":"page","content":"CDN 优化","tags":[],"url":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization"},"393":{"id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization-0","page_id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization","content":"优化阿里云的 CDN 流量"},"394":{"id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization-1","page_id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization#cdn-流量优化实战指南","content":"CDN 流量优化实战指南"},"395":{"id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization-2","page_id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization#1-核心问题为什么有-etag-还有流量消耗","content":"1. 核心问题：为什么有 Etag 还有流量消耗？"},"396":{"id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization-3","page_id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization#2-最佳实践策略immutable-模式","content":"2. 最佳实践策略：Immutable 模式"},"397":{"id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization-4","page_id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization#3-阿里云-cdn-配置步骤","content":"3. 阿里云 CDN 配置步骤"},"398":{"id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization-5","page_id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization#31-步骤一配置客户端强缓存-关键","content":"3.1. 步骤一：配置客户端强缓存 (关键)"},"399":{"id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization-6","page_id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization#32-步骤二配置节点缓存-省回源流量","content":"3.2. 步骤二：配置节点缓存 (省回源流量)"},"400":{"id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization-7","page_id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization#33-避坑设置","content":"3.3. 避坑设置"},"401":{"id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization-8","page_id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization#4-验证方法-chrome-network","content":"4. 验证方法 (Chrome Network)"},"402":{"id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization-9","page_id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization#5-补充防盗链","content":"5. 补充：防盗链"},"403":{"id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization-10","page_id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization#6-常见-faq","content":"6. 常见 FAQ"},"404":{"id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization-11","page_id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization#1-核心问题为什么有-etag-还有流量消耗","content":"很多开发者认为有了 Etag (304 Not Modified) 就万事大吉了，但实际上："},"405":{"id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization-12","page_id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization#1-核心问题为什么有-etag-还有流量消耗","content":"协商缓存 (Etag/304): 客户端每次都要发请求问服务器“变没变”。虽然不传图片内容，但会产生HTTP 请求头流量和CDN 请求次数费用。积少成多，流量依然可观。"},"406":{"id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization-13","page_id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization#1-核心问题为什么有-etag-还有流量消耗","content":"强缓存 (Cache-Control): 客户端直接从本地磁盘/内存读取，完全不发起网络请求。流量消耗为 0。"},"407":{"id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization-14","page_id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization#1-核心问题为什么有-etag-还有流量消耗","content":"目标： 将图片加载从“协商缓存”升级为“强缓存”。"},"408":{"id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization-15","page_id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization#2-最佳实践策略immutable-模式","content":"采用 “文件名/URL 变更即更新，内容不变则永久缓存” 的策略。"},"409":{"id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization-16","page_id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization#2-最佳实践策略immutable-模式","content":"配置目标： 让客户端缓存图片 1 年 (31536000秒)。"},"410":{"id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization-17","page_id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization#2-最佳实践策略immutable-模式","content":"更新机制： 如果图片内容需要修改，不要在原文件名上覆盖，而是修改文件名（如 banner-v1.jpg -> banner-v2.jpg）或 URL 参数。"},"411":{"id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization-18","page_id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization#3-阿里云-cdn-配置步骤","content":"入口： 阿里云 CDN 控制台 -> 域名管理 -> [目标域名] -> 缓存配置。"},"412":{"id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization-19","page_id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization#31-步骤一配置客户端强缓存-关键","content":"这是让小程序/浏览器不发请求的核心。"},"413":{"id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization-20","page_id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization#31-步骤一配置客户端强缓存-关键","content":"切换到 【修改出站响应头】 (HTTP Response Header) 标签页。"},"414":{"id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization-21","page_id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization#31-步骤一配置客户端强缓存-关键","content":"点击 添加。"},"415":{"id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization-22","page_id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization#31-步骤一配置客户端强缓存-关键","content":"配置如下："},"416":{"id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization-23","page_id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization#31-步骤一配置客户端强缓存-关键","content":"参数: Cache-Control"},"417":{"id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization-24","page_id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization#31-步骤一配置客户端强缓存-关键","content":"取值: max-age=31536000, immutable"},"418":{"id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization-25","page_id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization#31-步骤一配置客户端强缓存-关键","content":"策略: 拒绝 (或覆盖)"},"419":{"id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization-26","page_id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization#31-步骤一配置客户端强缓存-关键","content":"作用： 强制给所有响应加上缓存 1 年且不可变的指令。"},"420":{"id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization-27","page_id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization#31-步骤一配置客户端强缓存-关键","content":"关于 immutable: 这是一个高级指令，告诉客户端“这文件在过期前绝对不会变”，能进一步减少用户手动刷新页面时产生的 304 请求（iOS/Webkit 内核支持极佳）。"},"421":{"id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization-28","page_id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization#32-步骤二配置节点缓存-省回源流量","content":"这是让 CDN 节点自己存住图片，少去 OSS 取货。"},"422":{"id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization-29","page_id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization#32-步骤二配置节点缓存-省回源流量","content":"切换到 【缓存过期时间】 标签页。"},"423":{"id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization-30","page_id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization#32-步骤二配置节点缓存-省回源流量","content":"添加规则："},"424":{"id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization-31","page_id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization#32-步骤二配置节点缓存-省回源流量","content":"类型: 文件后缀"},"425":{"id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization-32","page_id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization#32-步骤二配置节点缓存-省回源流量","content":"内容: jpg,jpeg,png,webp,gif"},"426":{"id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization-33","page_id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization#32-步骤二配置节点缓存-省回源流量","content":"过期时间: 1 年"},"427":{"id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization-34","page_id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization#32-步骤二配置节点缓存-省回源流量","content":"权重: 99"},"428":{"id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization-35","page_id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization#33-避坑设置","content":"客户端跟随 CDN 缓存策略： 建议 【关闭】。"},"429":{"id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization-36","page_id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization#33-避坑设置","content":"原因： 自动跟随往往很机械，无法添加 immutable 等高级指令。建议通过“修改出站响应头”来显式控制，逻辑更清晰。"},"430":{"id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization-37","page_id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization#4-验证方法-chrome-network","content":"不要直接按 F5 刷新验证！浏览器对 F5 有特殊处理。"},"431":{"id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization-38","page_id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization#4-验证方法-chrome-network","content":"正确验证步骤："},"432":{"id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization-39","page_id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization#4-验证方法-chrome-network","content":"打开开发者工具 -> Network。"},"433":{"id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization-40","page_id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization#4-验证方法-chrome-network","content":"取消勾选 Disable cache。"},"434":{"id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization-41","page_id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization#4-验证方法-chrome-network","content":"在地址栏输入图片 URL，按回车 (或在页面中点击链接跳转)。"},"435":{"id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization-42","page_id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization#4-验证方法-chrome-network","content":"观察结果："},"436":{"id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization-43","page_id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization#4-验证方法-chrome-network","content":"Status: 200 OK (from disk cache) 或 (from memory cache)。"},"437":{"id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization-44","page_id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization#4-验证方法-chrome-network","content":"Time: 0ms 或 1ms。"},"438":{"id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization-45","page_id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization#4-验证方法-chrome-network","content":"Response Headers: 点击请求查看，必须包含 Cache-Control: max-age=31536000, immutable。"},"439":{"id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization-46","page_id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization#4-验证方法-chrome-network","content":"常见误区排查："},"440":{"id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization-47","page_id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization#4-验证方法-chrome-network","content":"现象： 状态是 200 (disk cache)，但 Header 里没有 Cache-Control。"},"441":{"id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization-48","page_id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization#4-验证方法-chrome-network","content":"原因： 浏览器读取的是配置生效前下载的旧缓存。"},"442":{"id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization-49","page_id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization#4-验证方法-chrome-network","content":"解决： 勾选 Disable cache 刷新一次（强行更新缓存），然后再取消勾选验证。"},"443":{"id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization-50","page_id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization#5-补充防盗链","content":"为了防止流量被盗用，建议配置 Referer 白名单。"},"444":{"id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization-51","page_id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization#5-补充防盗链","content":"微信小程序 Referer 格式：\nhttps://servicewechat.com/{appid}/{version}/page-frame.html"},"445":{"id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization-52","page_id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization#5-补充防盗链","content":"CDN 白名单推荐配置："},"446":{"id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization-53","page_id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization#5-补充防盗链","content":"servicewechat.com"},"447":{"id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization-54","page_id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization#5-补充防盗链","content":"*.servicewechat.com"},"448":{"id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization-55","page_id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization#5-补充防盗链","content":"注意： 开发工具中有时 Referer 包含 devtools，上述通配符已包含此情况。"},"449":{"id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization-56","page_id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization#6-常见-faq","content":"Q: 为什么我配置了 max-age，刷新页面还是 304？\nA: 浏览器的 F5/刷新按钮 会强制加上 Cache-Control: max-age=0，迫使浏览器向服务器发起协商验证。这是浏览器标准行为。正常用户点击进入页面时，是会走强缓存的。"},"450":{"id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization-57","page_id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization#6-常见-faq","content":"Q: 监控里有少量的 4xx 错误正常吗？\nA: 正常。通常是 404 (图片不存在) 或 403 (防盗链拦截)。只要业务显示正常，且 4xx 比例极低，属于互联网背景噪音，可忽略。"},"451":{"id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization-58","page_id":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/cdn_optimization#6-常见-faq","content":"Q: 图片刚上传，第一个访问的用户会回源吗？\nA: 会。第一个用户触发 CDN 回源拉取并缓存，后续用户（以及该用户后续的访问）将直接命中 CDN 或本地缓存。如果需要极致体验，可以使用 CDN 的 “预热” 功能。"},"452":{"id":"/docs/devops/pingora_proxy","page_id":"/docs/devops/pingora_proxy","type":"page","content":"pingora 反向代理实战","tags":[],"url":"/docs/devops/pingora_proxy"},"453":{"id":"/docs/devops/pingora_proxy-0","page_id":"/docs/devops/pingora_proxy","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/pingora_proxy","content":"学习使用 pingora 搭建一个反向代理"},"454":{"id":"/docs/devops/pingora_proxy-1","page_id":"/docs/devops/pingora_proxy","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/devops/pingora_proxy#pingora-是什么","content":"pingora 是什么"},"455":{"id":"/docs/devops/pingora_proxy-2","page_id":"/docs/devops/pingora_proxy","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/devops/pingora_proxy#快速上手-pingora","content":"快速上手 pingora"},"456":{"id":"/docs/devops/pingora_proxy-3","page_id":"/docs/devops/pingora_proxy","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/devops/pingora_proxy#开搞代码","content":"开搞代码"},"457":{"id":"/docs/devops/pingora_proxy-4","page_id":"/docs/devops/pingora_proxy","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/devops/pingora_proxy#热豆腐","content":"热豆腐"},"458":{"id":"/docs/devops/pingora_proxy-5","page_id":"/docs/devops/pingora_proxy","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/devops/pingora_proxy#现在开始介绍一下搭建过程","content":"现在开始介绍一下搭建过程"},"459":{"id":"/docs/devops/pingora_proxy-6","page_id":"/docs/devops/pingora_proxy","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/pingora_proxy#pingora-是什么","content":"pingora 是 cloudflare 公司开源的一个代理框架，本意是为了弥补一些 nginx 的不足。\n我研究 pingora 的原因纯粹是想学习一下 rust，要说 pingora 能不能很好的替代 nginx，\n还得看大家的需求。"},"460":{"id":"/docs/devops/pingora_proxy-7","page_id":"/docs/devops/pingora_proxy","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/pingora_proxy#快速上手-pingora","content":"pingora源码官方地址pingora快速上手文档"},"461":{"id":"/docs/devops/pingora_proxy-8","page_id":"/docs/devops/pingora_proxy","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/pingora_proxy#快速上手-pingora","content":"从 pingora 的快速文档可以看出来 pingora 其实只是开源了一个可变成的 http 服务框架，\n有兴趣的朋友可以按照教程跑一下。我自己因为跑不通他们的 1.1.1.1 的服务器，所以没成功。\n但是他是自带了一个代理服务器需要的组件。所有的代码我还没有研究过，本文仅解释一下被用来\n实现反向代理的组件"},"462":{"id":"/docs/devops/pingora_proxy-9","page_id":"/docs/devops/pingora_proxy","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/pingora_proxy#热豆腐","content":"心急的朋友可以直接看下面是我搞得一个项目 demo项目源码位置可以根据 README 里的说明来实现一个反向代理"},"463":{"id":"/docs/devops/pingora_proxy-10","page_id":"/docs/devops/pingora_proxy","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/pingora_proxy#现在开始介绍一下搭建过程","content":"要实现反向代理，首先需要添加 pingora 的依赖，修改 cargo.toml\n添加"},"464":{"id":"/docs/devops/pingora_proxy-11","page_id":"/docs/devops/pingora_proxy","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/pingora_proxy#现在开始介绍一下搭建过程","content":"pingora 的两个组件用来实现反向代理"},"465":{"id":"/docs/devops/pingora_proxy-12","page_id":"/docs/devops/pingora_proxy","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/pingora_proxy#现在开始介绍一下搭建过程","content":"ServerServer是在 server mod 下。主要用来启动一个 http 服务。关键代码如下"},"466":{"id":"/docs/devops/pingora_proxy-13","page_id":"/docs/devops/pingora_proxy","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/pingora_proxy#现在开始介绍一下搭建过程","content":"ProxyHttpProxyHttp是在 proxy_trait mod下\nProxyHttp封装了关键的代理需要的方法，要实现反向代理，我们需要创建一个 struct，并实现 ProxyHttp trait\n在 MyProxy 中实现一个方法 upstream_peer，例子如下"},"467":{"id":"/docs/devops/pingora_proxy-14","page_id":"/docs/devops/pingora_proxy","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/pingora_proxy#现在开始介绍一下搭建过程","content":"这里的逻辑就是在 upstream_peer 里返回一个反向代理解析出来的可访问的上游地址"},"468":{"id":"/docs/devops/pingora_proxy-15","page_id":"/docs/devops/pingora_proxy","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/pingora_proxy#现在开始介绍一下搭建过程","content":"在系统的调用层面，被调用方一般被叫做上游。"},"469":{"id":"/docs/devops/pingora_proxy-16","page_id":"/docs/devops/pingora_proxy","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/pingora_proxy#现在开始介绍一下搭建过程","content":"所有，反向代理的逻辑在这里实现就行了。\n首先，我们需要做一个反向代理的规则配置逻辑。我这里基于 yaml 配置反向代理。\nyaml 格式如下"},"470":{"id":"/docs/devops/pingora_proxy-17","page_id":"/docs/devops/pingora_proxy","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/pingora_proxy#现在开始介绍一下搭建过程","content":"这个格式的代理就会实现uri 前缀是 /path/to/9081 的请求，转发到 localhost:9081，接下来就开始做配置识别的逻辑。\n依赖添加"},"471":{"id":"/docs/devops/pingora_proxy-18","page_id":"/docs/devops/pingora_proxy","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/pingora_proxy#现在开始介绍一下搭建过程","content":"load_configs 函数就是用来加载配置文件的，配置文件的路径默认是 /app/config/config.yaml，\n但是可以通过环境变量 CONFIG_PATH 来指定配置文件的路径。"},"472":{"id":"/docs/devops/pingora_proxy-19","page_id":"/docs/devops/pingora_proxy","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/pingora_proxy#现在开始介绍一下搭建过程","content":"有了配置的识别逻辑，我们就可以创建一个函数来返回所有的代理规则"},"473":{"id":"/docs/devops/pingora_proxy-20","page_id":"/docs/devops/pingora_proxy","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/pingora_proxy#现在开始介绍一下搭建过程","content":"这个方法用来从配置里解析出所有的反向代理地址，并返回一个 map，key 是路由，\nvalue 是LoadBalancer。这个是用来做代理关键的组件。"},"474":{"id":"/docs/devops/pingora_proxy-21","page_id":"/docs/devops/pingora_proxy","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/pingora_proxy#现在开始介绍一下搭建过程","content":"定义MyProxy，并实现 ProxyHttp trait。MyProxy的属性有两个，一个是 lbs，\n是一个代理路径到上游服务器的映射。现在开始实现 upstream_peer 方法。"},"475":{"id":"/docs/devops/pingora_proxy-22","page_id":"/docs/devops/pingora_proxy","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/devops/pingora_proxy#现在开始介绍一下搭建过程","content":"方法里就是获取请求的路径，然后检查是否有任何路由键是当前请求路径的前缀。如果有就\n替换匹配的部分路径，构建新的 path 和 query string，然后构建新的 Uri，并设置到\nsession 的请求头里。\n至此我们就完成了反向代理的逻辑。实际这个匹配其实还是有优化空间的，后续我再优化。\n完整代码参看前面给的代码样板地址。"},"476":{"id":"/docs/wechat/wechat_program_env_auto_switch","page_id":"/docs/wechat/wechat_program_env_auto_switch","type":"page","content":"微信小程序环境自动切换方法","tags":[],"url":"/docs/wechat/wechat_program_env_auto_switch"},"477":{"id":"/docs/wechat/wechat_program_env_auto_switch-0","page_id":"/docs/wechat/wechat_program_env_auto_switch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/wechat/wechat_program_env_auto_switch","content":"通过微信开发者工具的“自定义处理命令”，实现预览/上传时自动切换环境配置文件（如云开发环境ID、API域名等），从而实现本地开发和生产环境的无缝切换。"},"478":{"id":"/docs/wechat/wechat_program_env_auto_switch-1","page_id":"/docs/wechat/wechat_program_env_auto_switch","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/wechat/wechat_program_env_auto_switch#微信小程序环境自动切换方法","content":"微信小程序环境自动切换方法"},"479":{"id":"/docs/wechat/wechat_program_env_auto_switch-2","page_id":"/docs/wechat/wechat_program_env_auto_switch","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/wechat/wechat_program_env_auto_switch#一前端小程序端环境自动切换","content":"一、前端（小程序端）环境自动切换"},"480":{"id":"/docs/wechat/wechat_program_env_auto_switch-3","page_id":"/docs/wechat/wechat_program_env_auto_switch","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/wechat/wechat_program_env_auto_switch#1-原理","content":"1. 原理"},"481":{"id":"/docs/wechat/wechat_program_env_auto_switch-4","page_id":"/docs/wechat/wechat_program_env_auto_switch","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/wechat/wechat_program_env_auto_switch#2-步骤","content":"2. 步骤"},"482":{"id":"/docs/wechat/wechat_program_env_auto_switch-5","page_id":"/docs/wechat/wechat_program_env_auto_switch","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/wechat/wechat_program_env_auto_switch#1准备多套配置文件","content":"（1）准备多套配置文件"},"483":{"id":"/docs/wechat/wechat_program_env_auto_switch-6","page_id":"/docs/wechat/wechat_program_env_auto_switch","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/wechat/wechat_program_env_auto_switch#2自动切换脚本","content":"（2）自动切换脚本"},"484":{"id":"/docs/wechat/wecha